2026-11-11 10:23:38,016 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: File detection only, NO prefetch execution evidence
2026-11-11 10:23:38,017 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: samdump.dll presence doesn't prove credential dumping occurred
2026-11-11 10:23:38,018 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Impact**: Severely overstated severity for a file that may never have been executed
2026-11-11 10:23:38,018 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **2. Deleted Files (DOWNGRADED: MEDIUM → LOW, Confirmed → Inference)**
2026-11-11 10:23:38,019 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: Finding accounted for only ~180 of 7038 "suspicious" deletions (5%)
2026-11-11 10:23:38,019 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: Missing 92% are likely normal Windows cleanup (browser cache, temp files)
2026-11-11 10:23:38,020 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Impact**: Evidence overstates deliberate artifact destruction
2026-11-11 10:23:38,020 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **3. "Hacking Tools" (DOWNGRADED: HIGH → MEDIUM, Confirmed → Inference)**
2026-11-11 10:23:38,021 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: Conflated forensic tools (Ethereal, WinPcap) with attack tools
2026-11-11 10:23:38,021 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: These are standard in IT admin, penetration testing, and forensic analysis
2026-11-11 10:23:38,023 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Evidence**: Packet capture shows legitimate web browsing to MSN services, not MITM attacks
2026-11-11 10:23:38,024 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **4. IRC Communication (DOWNGRADED: HIGH → MEDIUM, Confirmed → Inference)**
2026-11-11 10:23:38,026 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: Generic channel names (#QCWare, #soupandchives) presented as malicious C2
2026-11-11 10:23:38,027 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: Undernet.org hosted diverse legitimate communities; no actual malicious commands found
2026-11-11 10:23:38,028 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Impact**: cservice.undernet.org references are standard channel administration
2026-11-11 10:23:38,029 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **5. Anomalous Network Activity (DOWNGRADED: HIGH → MEDIUM, Confirmed → Inference)**
2026-11-11 10:23:38,030 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: Claimed MITM attack preparation without evidence of interception
2026-11-11 10:23:38,031 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: bulk.tcp data shows system's own outbound web traffic, not network sniffing
2026-11-11 10:23:38,032 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Impact**: Tool execution ≠ attack activity
2026-11-11 10:23:38,033 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **6. TELNET Execution (DOWNGRADED: HIGH → LOW, Inference → Inference)**
2026-11-11 10:23:38,034 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Issue**: Single execution presented as lateral movement evidence
2026-11-11 10:23:38,034 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Counter**: One TELNET invocation without successful connection records
2026-11-11 10:23:38,035 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Impact**: Common admin tool in 2004; no network evidence of compromise
